Package: scwbTrajectory
Type: Package
Title: Provisional Trajectory Operations for scworkbench
Version: 0.1.4
Authors@R: person("Hendrik A.", "de Weerd", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "dirkdeweerd.work@gmail.com")
Description: Explicitly activated provisional ABI v3 operation pack containing
    branch comparison, route smoothing, analytical path construction and
    scoring, trajectory-segment composition, and grouped S2 trajectory
    operations, Slingshot fitting/projection, scalar pseudotime adaptation,
    permutation-qualified trajectory signal-region detection,
    Monocle3 fitting/projection,
    Palantir fitting/projection, and single change-point detection along
    pseudotime for scworkbench.
    It is not a standard-profile dependency.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: digest, jsonlite, methods, scworkbench, RANN, splines, stats, utils
Suggests: DBI, fs, igraph, Matrix, monocle3, rhdf5, S4Vectors, SingleCellExperiment, slingshot
RoxygenNote: 7.3.3
